{
  "schema": "sn87-public-manifest/0.2",
  "status": "EXPORT_SET_DECIDED_CARD_18B",
  "note": "Decides which tracked files of the private source repository are exported into the public repository. Every tracked file must match exactly one class (scripts/check_manifest.py, run by tests/test_public_manifest.py). Classes: allow (exported), private (tracked here, never exported), review_required (undecided; must stay empty), deny (secrets and run state; never exported). If a file ever matched more than one class the precedence is deny, private, review_required, allow, and the check reports the overlap as a failure; a file that matches no class also fails. scripts/export_public.py builds the export from this manifest and refuses to run on a dirty working tree. Paths are relative to the repository root.",
  "allow": [
